# Upscale weights. Unlike the two directories above these are not produced by a
# build plugin, so a fresh clone has to fetch them before the local WebGPU
# upscaler can load — see docs/local-upscale.md.
client/public/models/*.onnx
# Upstream Real-ESRGAN weights, fetched rather than authored. tools/upscale-export
# converts these to the .onnx above; see docs/local-upscale.md.
*.pth
